{"name": "Rentcthulhu", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rentcthulhuis a deck-building roguelike where you play as a Card Priest. The cards in your hand are no ordinary deck\u2014they are fragments of \"True Fairy Tales\" torn asunder by the Great Old Ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"288\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885170/extras/5efe467b924180cb9353e55c0663e600.poster.avif?t=1769550401\" width=\"630\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885170/extras/5efe467b924180cb9353e55c0663e600.webm?t=1769550401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885170/extras/5efe467b924180cb9353e55c0663e600.mp4?t=1769550401\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep within the borders of a dark fairytale realm, the Great Old Ones have delivered a divine decree to you, a novice priest: If you cannot weave a logical web of \"Causal Combos\" (Score) within the time limit, this absurd forest will be devoured by eternal night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"282\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885170/extras/7e23a338373c6d1be4263e84d64339f4.poster.avif?t=1769550401\" width=\"630\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885170/extras/7e23a338373c6d1be4263e84d64339f4.webm?t=1769550401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885170/extras/7e23a338373c6d1be4263e84d64339f4.mp4?t=1769550401\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the Priest, you must start from the smallest suit connections, rebuilding the bonds between races. Stack your score amidst chaotic logic to bargain for the world's final glimmer of dawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"348\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885170/extras/35851e84a62c4ffed965ed39a9faa226.poster.avif?t=1769550401\" width=\"620\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885170/extras/35851e84a62c4ffed965ed39a9faa226.webm?t=1769550401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885170/extras/35851e84a62c4ffed965ed39a9faa226.mp4?t=1769550401\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A dark fairytale deckbuilder where you serve Ancient Gods. Reconstruct shattered stories using card suits and racial synergies. Stack high scores to complete Oracle challenges in this twisted roguelike adventure. Can you mend the fragments before the darkness wins?", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885170/924308b777ca782f086b5af5c91288a78e2bc371/header.jpg?t=1769550401", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Casual", "Roguelike Deckbuilder", "Strategy", "Deckbuilding", "Choices Matter", "Roguelite"], "developers": "BQ", "publishers": "BQ", "release_date": "2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3885170", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "28 January 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/OhT5HZDWCQA", "first_seen": 1769554800.0, "review_rank": 1357}